If the participants do not arrive in {%t:18} within 2 weeks, the race will be declared invalid.

The Hanseatic League council.
{%+:12}

column3:
Heis seilene!

Kappseilasen har begynt.
Paa startstreken staar foelgende deltakere:

{%R:02} {%v:02} {%n:02} {%s:1B}
{%R:03} {%v:03} {%n:03} {%s:1C}
{%R:04} {%v:04} {%n:04} {%s:1D}
{%R:05} {%v:05} {%n:05} {%s:1E}
