{%R:07} {%v:07} {%n:07} {%s:20}
{%R:08} {%v:08} {%n:08} {%s:21}
{%R:09} {%v:09} {%n:09} {%s:22}

Hvis deltakerne ikke kommer fram til {%t:18} innen 2 uker, blir kappseilasen erklaert ugyldig.

Hansaens raad.
{%+:12}

column2:
Patrol destination

The next destination on my intended trade route is {%t:00}. So get your ship, {%s:08}, to {%t:00} as soon as possible.

{%N:06}

column3:
Patruljemaal

Neste maal paa min planlagte handelsrute er {%t:00}. Send derfor skipet Deres, {%s:08}, til {%t:00} saa snart som mulig.

{%N:06}

column2:
So where are you? I told you to set off soon. In the meantime, my enemies must have thought that my convoy had sunk long since and will have sailed off somewhere else.
So I really don't think you deserve a reward.

{%N:06}

column3:
Hvor blir De av? Jeg sa at De skulle dra snart. I mellomtiden har fiendene mine sikkert trodd at konvoien min for lengst var sunket, og seilt et annet sted.
Jeg mener altsaa virkelig ikke at De fortjener noen beloenning.

{%N:06}

column2:
So where are you? I told you to set off soon. In the meantime, my enemies must have thought that my convoy had sunk long since and will have sailed off somewhere else.
So I consider {%c:09} to be ample payment for your trouble.

{%N:06}

column3:
Hvor blir De av? Jeg sa at De skulle dra snart. I mellomtiden har fiendene mine sikkert trodd at konvoien min for lengst var sunket, og seilt et annet sted.
Jeg anser derfor {%c:09} som rikelig betaling for bryet.

{%N:06}
